OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh bomb relatives criticise
OL,4,AIrish government as officer gives
OL,5,Apre-recorded evidence
OL,6,
OL,7,FRelatives of victims of the 1998 Real
OL,8,FIRA Omagh bomb atrocity have described
OL,9,Fthe Irish Government's contribution to
OL,10,Fthe inquiry as a "farce" after evidence
OL,11,Ffrom a senior police officer was
OL,12,Fdelivered in a pre-recorded video.
OL,14,FKevin Skelton, who lost his wife
OL,15,FPhilomena in the bomb, said he was
OL,16,F"finished" with the inquiry and vowed
OL,17,Fnot to return.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
