OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh bomb relatives criticise
OL,4,AIrish government as officer gives
OL,5,Apre-recorded evidence
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeparately Claire Hayes, whose brother
OL,8,FAlan Radford was also killed in the
OL,9,Fattack which claimed 29 lives including
OL,10,Fa woman who was pregnant with twins,
OL,11,Fsaid it appeared the Irish government
OL,12,Fwas not willing to offer its full
OL,13,Fsupport.
OL,15,FCounsel to the inquiry acknowledged
OL,16,Fthat the form of evidence had
OL,17,F"limitations".
